build*/
out/
# The JUCE checkout for the plugin (Phase 6): fetched, or copied from a sibling build.
ThirdParty/
*.wav
*.mid
!Tests/data/*.mid
__pycache__/
.vs/
*.user
Tools/corpus/cache/
# Phase 8 training: the dataset cache is derived from the bought MIDI packs and stays local, and so
# do the checkpoints, from which the training data could be read back. Only the exported .phosmdl,
# its .ref.txt and the statistics are committed.
Tools/train/runs/
Tools/train/cache/
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.npz
# The wavetable round: the measurement cache of Tools/wt_select.py holds all 2191 rows of Noctuary's
# library, is 1.4 MB, is rebuilt in 56 s, and only means anything on a machine that has that
# library. What is committed is the choice it led to (Tools/wt_selection.json) and the pack.
Tools/wt_measure.json
# Phase 9, the release path: everything Deploy/build_release.ps1 makes. The staging folder is a copy
# of build outputs, Deploy/out holds the setup and the archive (covered by "out/" above), and the
# reference render is a .wav (covered by "*.wav"). What is committed is the scripts, the Inno Setup
# script and the icon.
Deploy/stage/
Deploy/manual-work/
